[0.013, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[39;49m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[29d\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[J\u001b[H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m Foyer                                                                         4:17:00 am           \u001b[4;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYou're in.\r\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "The plan now is simple: go to your lab, plant the bomb, and run. The prototype will be destroyed.\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "The military will have no way to continue the experiment. No-one will die.\r\u001b[9dThe guard is out securing the grounds. The building is empty. You have six minutes.\r\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mAll Things Devours\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mWritten for IFComp 2004 by half sick of shadows.\r\u001b[14dThis is the post-competition release.\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.001, "o", "It is in the public domain and may thus be freely copied or modified.\r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "First-time players should type 'about'.\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 3 / Serial number 050325 / Inform v6.30 Library 6/11\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mFoyer\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mA darkened foyer, presided over by a security desk near the north wall. Floating above it in the\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "capacious darkness is a small landing. A set of stairs both rises up to meet it and stretches\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "downwards into the dark.\r\u001b[24dIn the north wall is a closed automatic door.\r\u001b[26dTo the south is a set of automatic doors leading out into the inky night.\r\u001b[28d>"]
