[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mFoyer           \u001b[1;85H"]
[0.000, "o", "20\r\u001b[21d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mFoyer\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mA darkened foyer, presided over by a security desk near the north wall. Floating above it in the\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "capacious darkness is a small landing. A set of stairs both rises up to meet it and stretches\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "downwards into the dark.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "In the north wall is a closed automatic door.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "To the south is a set of automatic doors leading out into the inky night.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.412, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40ms\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mo\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mu\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mt\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mh\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.096, "o", "\u001b[2;2H\u001b[37m\u001b[40msouth\u001b[K\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "(first pressing the green exit button)\u001b[K\r\u001b[4d"]
[0.000, "o", "The main doors open onto the night.\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "You slip out into the night, darting quickly through the Cambridge shadows until you reach the quiet\u001b[7;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "corner where you left your car. Exhausted, you gently start the cold motor and roll off towards the\r\u001b[8dinterstate"]
[0.000, "o", ".\u001b[K\r\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "Morning finds you in a truck-stop cafe, near Woodstock, NY. You sit there, anxiously watching the\r\u001b[11dmorning news as you sip your bitter coffee.\r\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[13d*******\r\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "Wednesday 13th October 2004\u001b[K\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "At precisely 9:27 am this morning a catastrophe of unprecedented scale occurred. An immense\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "explosion -- that could only have been atomic in nature -- tore through the city and suburbs of\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "Boston MA, destroying all in its path. Casualties are expected to number in the millions. The\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "President has declared a state of emergency across the nation and the military is mobilizing for a\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "possible war with the as yet unknown enemy.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mThis thing all things devours:\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[K\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mbirds, beasts, trees, flowers;\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "gnaws iron, bites steel;\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "grinds hard stones to meal;\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[K\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mslays king, ruins town;\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "and beats high mountain down.\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[K\r\u001b[30d[MORE]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
